# Committed on purpose. These NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are NOT secret — Next.js
# inlines them into the browser bundle, so they are already public on czaah.com.
# They live here so CI builds (Cloudflare Workers Builds) can prerender pages
# that construct a Supabase client at build time.
#
# Real secrets stay OUT of git: server keys are Worker secrets (wrangler secret),
# and local overrides go in .env.local / .dev.vars (both gitignored).

